etty scary  to be fair asta can still use anti-magic  in his base form so he can still fight  weaker opponents but if another highest  ranked devil  emerges from the cliff off before the 30  minutes are up  and if this devil turns out to be even  stronger than lilith  and the mom everyone will be pretty  screwed including  asta this means that the black bulls and  the other members of the infiltration  squad  need to defeat the dark triad right away  they need to  take out the dark triad and stop the  cliffhoth ritual before the next gate is  opened and before  morris makes his next deadly move  but right now the dark triad can use 100  of their devil's power so that means  that they won't  be easy to take down the focus of the  chapter then switches back to the fight  between  dante and jack jack is doing his best  and he is cutting and slashing dante  over and over and over again but as  strong as jack's slash magic  is with its ability to adapt to the  magic of his opponent  jack's slashing simply cannot overcome  dante's overpowered body magic which  allows dante to just keep regenerating  no matter how many times he is cut we  really have to show some respect for  jack here he is fighting like crazy and  he refuses to give up  even though it is clear that he simply  cannot overpower  dante jack really is a fierce and  determined warrior  and he refuses to give up no matter what  so i have to say that he really is a  worthy rival  to our boy yami i don't think he'll ever  be able to defeat yami but still  respect even dante acknowledges jack's  strength and courage  and he is grateful to jack for giving  him a good fight  however dante announces that this fight  is now  over and he prepares to destroy jack but  before dante can kill  jack the entire upper half of his body  is blown to bits by a massive exploding  fireball as dante regenerates he sees  none other than magna and zora emerging  from the smoke  and heading right for him magna and zora  both  smirk a